<title>UK: New York sets $75 million August 2002 FRN.</title>
<headline>New York sets $75 million August 2002 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible floating-rate issue has been increased to $425 million from $350 million, lead manager Goldman Sachs said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF NEW YORK</p>
<p> AMT   *$75 MLN	 BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +25 BP    PAY DATE  **24.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA1	ISS PRICE  ++	  FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB+	REOFFER    ++</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    =	   SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>	     *FUNGIBLE WITH OUTSTANDING $350 MILLION FRN, ORIGINAL</p>
<p>		LAUNCHED IN JANUARY</p>
<p>	    ++TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
